# C++ HackerRank Solutions 🚀

[![C++](https://img.shields.io/badge/C%2B%2B-17-blue.svg)](https://isocpp.org/)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)](LICENSE)
[![HackerRank](https://img.shields.io/badge/HackerRank-Solver-brightgreen.svg)](https://www.hackerrank.com/)

## Overview

A growing collection of well-structured **C++ solutions to HackerRank challenges** and core programming problems. This repository is focused on building strong problem-solving, logic, and competitive programming skills through consistent practice.

## Repository Goals

- Develop a solid foundation in C++
- Practice algorithmic thinking and coding patterns
- Solve HackerRank and problem-based challenges
- Write clean, readable, reusable code
- Build a strong base for DSA and advanced programming

## Topics Covered

- Introduction
- Basic Data Types
- Conditionals
- Loops
- Arrays
- Strings
- Functions
- Searching
- Sorting
- Recursion
- STL

